      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I don't understand why the instance link cannot seemingly be reused ever once closed. A group I'm in closed an instance and more than a week later we cannot use the same instance link still? These should start working again once no one is left in the instance or after some timeout eg. 24 hours after the instance was closed. This would allow groups to use the same instance link to advertise their event on a regular schedule but still be able to close the instance once the event is open.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
