      "sourceFeatureExtractionItemID": null,
      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I would argue that the \"Close Instance\" feature wasn't designed to be a \"make my instance private so no one else can join\". It is intended to be used for when an instance is closing because the management is leaving or the event is over and the population can slowly wind down until the instance is fully empty.\n\nIf you want to be able to control when people can join the instance, it sounds more like you want to change the type of an instance at will, so I would suggest you take a look at this instead: [ability-to-upgradedowngrade-instance-types](https://vrchat.canny.io/feature-requests/p/ability-to-upgradedowngrade-instance-types)",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
