      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "@{60077db69f683a5a8eae2203|full_name}: I have heard of similar issues in the past, about instance IDs not being recycled in the way that we expect. But this sounds more like a critical bug that you should be making a dedicated bug report for, rather than attach it to an unrelated feature request like this.",
