      "mergeID": "66281bf8d1a1d830d646e120",
      "mergedPostDetails": "I would like the instance owner to be able to unlock the instance once it has been locked. For example, in a game world, if I want to play with a specific number of people and I've locked the room after 10 people have gathered, but during the game some players leave and I want to recruit new members to make it 10 again, or if I want to recruit new participants in the same instance later, I strongly feel the need for this feature.",
